{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_221141e91323ad3f5b8d977e19da2261483cca88a733979c39a6ca6050ffc5cc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_667d49cf1da5b60a1daf00288085f41caa8eac8f78b38423709fe5f62969cde5"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"The hook validates the `## Clarified` record by four rules: every question has an `->` answer, no `Assumption:` line, at least one answered question, and a `Branch:` line; only plain bullets count, not fenced templates or HTML comments.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_31280e69718f5df695fe5f14463047bbca3f0c8d5b23dd326a5d2a1a48b99ac2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2db93a96f757cb9f495600bad3492b7dbdf633f95858da2186099b21a590da85","slc_b753d802c24f7cfd81d5dd1d4aa8751365fa6a79dfa5d2b851334911bf4c3e88"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"Repository development practice: tests run with `python3 -m pytest tests/ -q`; the hook tests execute the stdin/stdout JSON filters end to end as subprocesses, plus a second layer pinning the core text and the skill.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_459044351bca2811a0f1dfeb503c5caa0e0326265ee2e55c37ab52d69aed1308","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2f580d7b84f0f617e53ecf899be48e625e5b03c5733758289fc19ea9278db332","slc_e2764cf0d1f83ac66d51b9f0105e24356667266541e3f627c09f80e6fd8704d5"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"Finished teammates are reaped automatically at session end and on a rate-limited idle sweep (default 1-hour idle threshold); metrics go to ~/.claude/fable-orch/metrics.jsonl, summarized by `python3 scripts/stats.py`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_97747af4959536a2c1c823f2d435c265e86719947054d374d2222a38276fbaf4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2f580d7b84f0f617e53ecf899be48e625e5b03c5733758289fc19ea9278db332","slc_5274003a214c9e7051770d0e284a00750e6eacbc369ee6a223742517ae514291"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"Behavior is configurable via env vars under `\"env\"` in ~/.claude/settings.json: a 1500-char spawn threshold, per-gate disable flags, stop-gate frequency, metrics logging, and teammate reaping settings.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9955ecbac2a8f4ebeaa9c17c3b54dc2ac955e614b2931da40be50086c2e95c8d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d8688549b4cacb90f32d847e984562b97a47b70a51f3a97829e52bb993e67f06"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"The hooks check record shape, not question fidelity, and enforcement depends on the host's hook pipeline, so users should verify behavior on their own setup.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5212a76b171883a4c28297660c2ab2ea8a5fae446d25a14c654af0cf19a3621","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ea797db768170c3ce54a197cea347745202b0eff3971d68856e5f377dce4fd2a"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"Four hooks enforce the workflow: a PreToolUse clarify gate, a PreToolUse spawn gate, a task-list gate on the third ledgerless tracker task, and a Stop gate when a turn ends with open ledger items.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ba06ecc7b65c9a364f9f0774f58a48032389467a8c6a003b2058060e7603f031","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c883385d815c85ecb7ea986bc9af3984d50460dddf2ec242e2956752a4bd8f6b"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"The product is a Claude Code plugin installed via the marketplace commands `/plugin marketplace add Rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator` and `/plugin install orchestrator@fable-orchestrator`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c791faff4a0967f3417cc22b62fdcb2e412d9073f2a123d1212a2293e6065760","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c2d1b0ee261166b52b6ad97716966d199c1fc40e59a952095fce7ba6f0624df6"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"Short spawns, forks, and teammates are never gated; a fully closed ledger from an earlier session does not disarm gates, and ledgers are retired by renaming to `LEDGER-<topic>-archive.md`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d0fcf10d2c3aa7937cd2ba83e241e5bd856c9eff75beeb3ff3d8f2b47d066e9b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_263f83e83386f6b107189526ec403dff34445eba161a2ab2d751e65e9bb28c73"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"The plugin needs `python3` on PATH, supports macOS and Linux only, and Claude Code must be restarted after installation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d29c7fd00cf1f945a8873a01f38024bba530442e3921b71ef287ec0234d98cd2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e086aa404fbce4bd58476c7fc90768a85be010bce0b2bf68c41ec28b23e01fcb"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"The clarify protocol in skills/clarify/SKILL.md scans seven axes (scope edge, acceptance, constraints, decision ownership, priority conflicts, existing-code contact, failure behavior) and always asks whether work lands on the current branch or a new one.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d4f95ba1c01c5d2cb4e33f8f385b8bd985dd6104b5bf3714e3deb18be4929184","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"rylaa/fable5-opus5-orchestrator@d258385088a6 snapshot b517b7606d696080","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d501911551fed5e031a47e22018380d66f80577ecbefebac45533155cd08457b"],"source_ids":["src_b095d662063659d48d7654c5740e83f9"],"text":"Sessions run as: chair reads the repo, asks all questions in rounds before planning, writes a ledger, then works directly or through workers; workers cannot ask the user anything.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_72fd54fdcfdb45569675844c4a0256b8"}
